.rdata:10BC528F                 db 'by moving the last key up and right at the same amount. Smoothing'
.rdata:10BC52D0                 db ' in the curve can help reduce elbow snapping (start stretching th'
.rdata:10BC5311                 db 'e arm slightly before target distance reaches arm length). To get'
