.rdata:10BD1D65                 db 's give a more heavy slowly responding camera.  Using different se'
.rdata:10BD1DA6                 db 'ttings per axis can yield a wide range of camera behaviors.',0
.rdata:10BD1DE2                 align 8
.rdata:10BD1DE8 aHowAggressivel_2 db 'How aggressively the camera tries to maintain the offset in the Y'
