.rdata:10BD2026                 db 'ttings per axis can yield a wide range of camera behaviors.',0
.rdata:10BD2062                 align 8
.rdata:10BD2068 aIfSetDampingWi db 'If set, damping will apply  only to target motion, but not to cam'
