.rdata:10BD28B9                 db 'rs are more responsive, rapidly adjusting the camera to keep the '
.rdata:10BD28FA                 db 'group in the frame.  Larger numbers give a more heavy slowly resp'
.rdata:10BD293B                 db 'onding camera.',0
.rdata:10BD294A                 align 10h
