.rdata:10BDA844                 db 'otated this number of radians (1 radian is approximately 57°) to '
.rdata:10BDA886                 db 'the right. This helps to break up symmetries and makes it possibl'
.rdata:10BDA8C7                 db 'e to resolve some situations much faster.',0Ah
.rdata:10BDA8F1                 db 0Ah
